#: scenario8:scenario8_52A585C6_D183_4D44_9B87_E24EC8892F9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47e912c47deeffa91b3cb47e84412b73bbd2e67a3708bbdff9be32a4f6143749
